{
 "source": "the 26 master capes (objs 25324-25349) imported from RS3 949: every cape texture was a lone op 39 sprite with opaque, opacity and hdr all pointing at it, so the client's only alpha source was the colour's red channel; each gets a grey alpha sprite carrying its colour sprite's own alpha channel, wired to the texture's opacity output, with effectCombiner 2 on the material",
 "naming": "the objs name every material through their retexture arrays: 2563 is Agility's own emblem (the Agility cape retextures nothing), every other cape retextures 2563 to its own material, and Invention retextures 2589 to 2590; 2562 and 2588 are the cape cloth (pixel-identical sprites 12042 and 12068), 2589 is Invention's base emblem (pixel-identical to Agility's 12043); the skill spellings are the RS3 material gamevals (master_skillcape_*), so Constitution keeps RS3's hitpoints",
